  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tCleverBirds: A Multiple-Choice Benchmark for Fine-grained Human Knowledge Tracing\n\t\n\nThis dataset accompanies the CleverBirds benchmark, designed to evaluate fine-grained human knowledge tracing. Details about the project, and links to paper and code can be found at https://cleverbirds-benchmark.github.io/.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tParticipant Data\n\t\n\nParticipant data is located in:\n\nparticipant_data/train.parquet\nparticipant_data/val.parquet\nparticipant_data/test.parquet\n\nEach split contains\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/bossemel/clever_birds.",
